{"seq":3,"slug":"preamp-converter-signal-chain","title":"前级、转换与信号链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/recording-acoustics/capture-equipment/preamp-converter-signal-chain","wordCount":2056,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"前级-转换与信号链\">前级、转换与信号链</h1><p>话筒输出的信号弱得惊人——一只动圈话筒对着普通人声，输出可能只有几毫伏，比线路电平低了上千倍。这点微弱电压要先被放大到可用强度，再被采样量化成数字，才能写进硬盘。这条从话筒插口到硬盘文件的路径，就是信号链；它上面每个环节的增益、噪声、阻抗和时钟，都在悄悄设定你这次录音的质量天花板。这一篇拆解话筒前级、模数转换和整条链路的工程细节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>信号链可以看成一串电平转换：话筒电平 → 线路电平 → 数字样本。每一级既是放大也是引入噪声和失真的机会，而「在哪一级加多少增益」这件事——增益结构——决定了最终的信噪比。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  M[话筒&lt;br/&gt;话筒电平 mV] --&gt; P[话筒前级&lt;br/&gt;放大至线路电平]&#10;  P --&gt; AD[模数转换 ADC&lt;br/&gt;采样+量化]&#10;  AD --&gt; DAW[DAW 数字音频工作站]&#10;  DAW --&gt; DA[数模转换 DAC]&#10;  DA --&gt; MON[监听音箱/耳机]&#10;  CLK[主时钟] -. 同步 .-&gt; AD&#10;  CLK -. 同步 .-&gt; DA&#10;  P -. 幻象+48V .-&gt; M&#10;  P -. 增益结构决定信噪比 .-&gt; AD\">flowchart TD\n  M[话筒&lt;br/&gt;话筒电平 mV] --&gt; P[话筒前级&lt;br/&gt;放大至线路电平]\n  P --&gt; AD[模数转换 ADC&lt;br/&gt;采样+量化]\n  AD --&gt; DAW[DAW 数字音频工作站]\n  DAW --&gt; DA[数模转换 DAC]\n  DA --&gt; MON[监听音箱/耳机]\n  CLK[主时钟] -. 同步 .-&gt; AD\n  CLK -. 同步 .-&gt; DA\n  P -. 幻象+48V .-&gt; M\n  P -. 增益结构决定信噪比 .-&gt; AD</pre><p>理解这条链有一条主线索：信噪比在第一级（前级）就基本定型，后面再怎么处理也补不回早期丢失的信号或混入的噪声。所以前级和增益结构是重中之重。话筒的灵敏度、自噪声等参数全部承接 <a href=\"microphone-principles-types\">传声器原理与类型</a>，本篇关注信号离开话筒之后的旅程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"话筒前级与增益结构\">话筒前级与增益结构</h2><p>话筒前级（preamp）的核心任务是把毫伏级的话筒电平干净地放大到约 +4 dBu 的线路电平——通常需要 40–60 dB 增益，灵敏度极低的铝带话筒甚至要 60–70 dB。这是整条链噪声最敏感的一环：因为信号此刻最弱，前级自身的噪声会被后续等比例放大，所以前级的等效输入噪声（EIN）指标至关重要，优秀前级可达 −128 dBu 上下。</p>\n<p>前级还负责提供 +48 V 幻象电源给电容话筒供电（无源铝带绝不能开，会烧铝带——这条铁律见上一篇），并常带高通滤波、衰减垫（pad）、相位翻转等实用开关。</p>\n<p>真正决定成败的是增益结构（gain staging）——如何在整条链上分配增益，让每一级都工作在「远离本底噪声、又远离削波」的舒适区。原则是尽量在第一级（前级）就把信号提到健康电平，让后续环节都在高信噪比下工作；既不能增益不足（信号淹没在噪声里），也不能过载削波。数字录音尤其要留足余量（headroom）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Headroom</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext> dBFS</mtext><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>peak</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Headroom} = 0\\ \\text{dBFS} - L_{\\text{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Headroom</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dBFS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>模拟时代追求贴近 0，数字时代则刻意把峰值留在 −12 至 −18 dBFS，给瞬态留空间、避免数字削波那种刺耳的硬失真。这套余量观念会一路延续到 <a href=\"../recording-practice/multitrack-recording\">多轨录音与分轨</a> 的录音电平管理和 <a href=\"../post-frontiers/immersive-spatial-audio\">沉浸式与空间音频（杜比全景声）</a> 的母带响度规范。</p>\n<h2 id=\"采样-量化与转换器\">采样、量化与转换器</h2><p>模数转换器（ADC）把连续的模拟电压变成离散的数字样本，做两件事：在时间上采样、在幅度上量化。</p>\n<p>采样率决定能记录的最高频率。奈奎斯特定理指出，要无失真地还原频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 的信号，采样率必须高于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s &gt; 2 f_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>人耳上限 20 kHz，所以 CD 用 44.1 kHz 已足够覆盖可听范围（留出抗混叠滤波的过渡带）。专业录音常用 48、88.2、96 kHz——更高采样率的价值不在「听得到更高频」，而在给滤波器更宽松的设计空间、降低时域处理的混叠风险，以及变速等后期处理留余地。超过奈奎斯特的频率若不滤除会折叠回可听区形成混叠失真，所以 ADC 前必有抗混叠滤波。</p>\n<p>位深决定幅度的量化精度，也即动态范围。每增加 1 bit，动态范围约增 6 dB：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DR</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>6.02</mn><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.76</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DR} \\approx 6.02 N + 1.76\\ \\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.02</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.76</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>16 bit 给约 96 dB 动态范围（CD 标准），24 bit 给约 144 dB——录音阶段普遍用 24 bit，巨大的动态余量让你不必把电平推得太满就能远离量化噪声，这正是上一节「峰值留 −18 dBFS」之所以可行的底气。位深不足时量化误差表现为与信号相关的失真，加入微量抖动（dither）可把它变成无害的白噪声。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>决定</th>\n<th>常见取值</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最高可录频率</td>\n<td>44.1/48/96 kHz</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s&gt;2f_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，余量留给滤波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位深 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>动态范围</td>\n<td>24 bit（录音）/16 bit（CD）</td>\n<td>每 bit 约 +6 dB DR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抖动 dither</td>\n<td>量化失真去相关</td>\n<td>母带降位时加</td>\n<td>把失真变白噪声</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"链路细节-阻抗-平衡传输与时钟\">链路细节：阻抗、平衡传输与时钟</h2><p>放大和转换之外，几个「不出声但能毁掉录音」的工程细节同样关键。</p>\n<p>阻抗匹配上，话筒输出阻抗低（约 150–200 Ω），前级输入阻抗要高得多（常 1–2 kΩ，约 5–10 倍），这种「桥接」式连接保证电压传输高效。对铝带话筒，前级输入阻抗会明显影响其音色，所以许多前级提供可变输入阻抗。</p>\n<p>平衡传输是专业音频抗噪的基石。话筒线用两根信号线（一正一反相）加屏蔽，构成平衡线路；沿途感应进来的干扰对两根线是同相的，到接收端做差分相减时，信号（反相的两路相减叠加）保留、干扰（同相）抵消。这就是为什么专业话筒走 XLR 平衡口能拉几十米而不串入嗡声，而非平衡的乐器线稍长就吃噪声。</p>\n<p>时钟则是数字链的隐形指挥。每台数字设备靠时钟决定何时采样，多台设备协同时必须同步到同一主时钟，否则会出现咔哒声和抖动。时钟抖动（jitter）——采样时刻的微小不稳——会在转换中引入失真，所以高品质转换器都在低抖动时钟上下功夫。一块声卡/音频接口往往把前级、ADC/DAC、时钟集成在一起，它的素质直接框定了在 <a href=\"../recording-practice/studio-control-room-design\">录音棚与控制室设计</a> 里搭建一间棚时整条链路的上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监听回路-dac-与回放端\">监听回路：DAC 与回放端</h2><p>信号链不止是「进」，还有「出」。数字样本要变回能推动耳朵的声音，得经数模转换器（DAC）还原成模拟电压，再经监听放大推动音箱或耳机。DAC 同样需要重建滤波器去除采样产生的高频镜像、同样受时钟抖动影响，它的素质直接决定你监听到的是不是真实的混音。一条容易被忽视的事实是：你对录音所有的判断，都隔着这个回放端——若 DAC 染色、监听音箱不准、房间有问题，你就是在错误的参照下做决定。</p>\n<p>这就是为什么专业工作流里，监听链（DAC + 监听放大 + 音箱/耳机 + 房间）和录音链同等重要。录音链决定你能捕到多好的信号，监听链决定你能不能正确判断它。两者合起来才是完整的闭环，而房间这一环的处理与监听摆位，正是 <a href=\"../recording-practice/studio-control-room-design\">录音棚与控制室设计</a> 要解决的问题——本篇的转换器素质，是那间控制室能否「听得准」的硬件前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>信号链是「话筒电平 → 线路电平 → 数字样本」的多级电平转换，信噪比在前级这一级就基本定型，后期补不回。</li>\n<li>话筒前级提供 40–70 dB 增益和 +48 V 幻象供电；增益结构要让每级远离噪声又远离削波，数字录音把峰值留在 −12 至 −18 dBFS。</li>\n<li>ADC 同时采样（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_s&gt;2f_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，故 44.1 kHz 够用、更高采样率为滤波与后期留余地）和量化（位深每 bit 约 +6 dB 动态范围，录音用 24 bit）。</li>\n<li>阻抗桥接、平衡差分传输（抗共模干扰）、主时钟同步（抑制抖动）是不出声却决定成败的链路细节。</li>\n<li>本篇的余量与增益观念会延续到多轨录音电平管理和沉浸式母带响度规范。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前级、转换与信号链","id":"前级-转换与信号链"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"话筒前级与增益结构","id":"话筒前级与增益结构"},{"level":2,"text":"采样、量化与转换器","id":"采样-量化与转换器"},{"level":2,"text":"链路细节：阻抗、平衡传输与时钟","id":"链路细节-阻抗-平衡传输与时钟"},{"level":2,"text":"监听回路：DAC 与回放端","id":"监听回路-dac-与回放端"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"立体声拾音制式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/recording-acoustics/capture-equipment/stereo-techniques"},"next":{"title":"录音棚与控制室设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/recording-acoustics/recording-practice/studio-control-room-design"}}